.* QUIDSPNETA: DSPNETA, the network attributes. The empty :DATACOL.
.* sets the prompt width (colon at column 51); the blank rows after
.* the server entry end the first page where the goldens end it.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 24'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NETIDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SYSNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PNDSYSNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LCLNETID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LCLCPNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LCLLOCNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DFTMODE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=NODETYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTACPR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTACPRINM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXINTSSN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RAR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRSTS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRLOGSTS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRPRIFP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRDFTFP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRBCKFP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRBCKNET CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRRQSFP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRRQSNET CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRCTLD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRHLDCNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRFTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALRFTRLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBACN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXHOP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DDMACC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DDMACCLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PCSACC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PCSACCLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DFTNETTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DFTCNNLST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWANYNET CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=NWSDOMAIN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWVRTIP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWHPRTWR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=VRTAUTODEV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HPRPTHTMR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWADDCLU CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MDMCNTRYID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=NETSRVID CLASS=NETIDCL.
:VAR NAME=NETSRVCP CLASS=CPCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPNETA HELP=HLPNETA KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Network Attributes
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=50.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=SYSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Current system name
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PNDSYSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Pending system name
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=LCLNETID USAGE=OUTPUT.Local network ID
:DATAI VAR=LCLCPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Local control point name
:DATAI VAR=LCLLOCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Default local location
:DATAI VAR=DFTMODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Default mode
:DATAI VAR=NODETYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.APPN node type
:DATAI VAR=DTACPR USAGE=OUTPUT.Data compression
:DATAI VAR=DTACPRINM USAGE=OUTPUT.Intermediate data compression
:DATAI VAR=MAXINTSSN USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum number of intermediate sessions
:DATAI VAR=RAR USAGE=OUTPUT.Route addition resistance
:DATAI VAR=NETSRVID USAGE=OUTPUT.Server network ID/control point name
:DATAIX VAR=NETSRVCP USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=ALRSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert status
:DATAI VAR=ALRLOGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert logging status
:DATAI VAR=ALRPRIFP USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert primary focal point
:DATAI VAR=ALRDFTFP USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert default focal point
:DATAI VAR=ALRBCKFP USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert backup focal point
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=ALRBCKNET USAGE=OUTPUT.Network ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=ALRRQSFP USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert focal point to request
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=ALRRQSNET USAGE=OUTPUT.Network ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=ALRCTLD USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert controller description
:DATAI VAR=ALRHLDCNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert hold count
:DATAI VAR=ALRFTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Alert filter
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=ALRFTRLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Message queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=MSGQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBACN USAGE=OUTPUT.Job action
:DATAI VAR=MAXHOP USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum hop count
:DATAI VAR=DDMACC USAGE=OUTPUT.DDM request access
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DDMACCLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=PCSACC USAGE=OUTPUT.Client request access
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PCSACCLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DFTNETTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Default ISDN network type
:DATAI VAR=DFTCNNLST USAGE=OUTPUT.Default ISDN connection list
:DATAI VAR=ALWANYNET USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow AnyNet support
:DATAI VAR=NWSDOMAIN USAGE=OUTPUT.Network server domain
:DATAI VAR=ALWVRTIP USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow APPN virtual support
:DATAI VAR=ALWHPRTWR USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow HPR transport tower support
:DATAI VAR=VRTAUTODEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Autocreate APPC device limit
:DATAI VAR=HPRPTHTMR USAGE=OUTPUT.HPR path switch timers
:DATAI VAR=ALWADDCLU USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow add to cluster
:DATAI VAR=MDMCNTRYID USAGE=OUTPUT.Modem country or region ID
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPNETA.Display Network Attributes - Help
:P.This display shows the network attributes: the names the system goes
by on the network, how it takes part in APPN and alerts, where network
messages and printed output go, and what remote requests may do.
:P.Page down for the rest. CHGNETA changes them; a new system name takes
effect at the next IPL.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
